{
"markdown": "### KineticDock\n\nA scrolling carousel and touch magnification that make the Dock on your iPhone more lively and smooth.\n\n> **Note:** A separate tweak is required to enable the Floating Dock. iPad, landscape, and external displays are not supported, and the default Dock limit is not extended.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/KineticDock/Screenshots/1.png",
