{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/KineticDock/Screenshots/5.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 5"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 12,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Scrolling Carousel:** Adaptive icon sizing, depth, inertia, snapping, and saved rotation.\n- **Magnification Mode:** Center icon maximized with graduated neighbors and adaptive spacing.\n- **Independent App List:** Select and reorder up to 24 apps.\n- **Rich Customization:** Adjust icon size, magnification, Dock position, labels, glow, background, and haptics.\n- **Compatibility:** Supports iPhone on iOS 15.x - 17.x (Rootless & RootHide).",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
